  (text "Gigabit Ethernet: CM5 ETH pairs -> RJ45 with integrated magnetics (HR911105A class), LEDs.\nHDMI0 -> full-size HDMI type A, TPD12S016-class ESD/level shifter, 5 V 55 mA.\nCharge-port USB-C (CC to CH224K, D+/D- to mux), host USB-C (USB3_1), USB-A x2 from VL817.\nSide switches: BOOT (nRPIBOOT), hard-kill (Buck A EN). Fan header 4-pin. RTC ML2032 holder.\nStatus LEDs on the top IO board via 10-pin FPC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.00 25.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d1b5237-e1fd-4f6e-81f6-e0a9071bc46d"))
)
